  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: avoid overflow in Levenshtein distance calculations\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-15742.patch: avoid overflow in Levenshtein distance calculations\n     - CVE-2026-15742\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: cross-check the result type of a portal running EXECUTE or FETCH\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-16239.patch: cross-check the result type of a portal running EXECUTE or FETCH\n     - CVE-2026-16239\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: do not expand backquotes in psql \\unrestrict\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-18408.patch: do not expand backquotes in psql \\unrestrict\n     - CVE-2026-18408\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: avoid assuming the length of pg_proc.protrftypes in pg_dump\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-19385.patch: avoid assuming the length of pg_proc.protrftypes in pg_dump\n     - CVE-2026-19385\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: check operator selectivity estimator ownership and input types\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-2004.patch: check operator selectivity estimator ownership and input types\n     - CVE-2026-2004\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: fix buffer overflow in pgcrypto pgp_pub_decrypt_bytea()\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-2005.patch: fix buffer overflow in pgcrypto pgp_pub_decrypt_bytea()\n     - CVE-2026-2005",
